{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Samurai GUNN 2</i></strong> is a fighting game for people who love fast, twitchy action games.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We devoted 3 years to rebuilding Samurai GUNN 2 from scratch in our own custom engine to ensure the online matches are fast and reliable, and to make it easy for us to support for years to come. With this solid foundation in place, you can look forward to regular updates with new characters, new stages, new modes, and various other improvements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>LOCAL AND ONLINE</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against friends  on the couch, or play online in 1v1 and Free-for-All battles. Enjoy reliable rollback netcode in Ranked and Casual Matchmaking.\u00a0You can even set up a private lobby to hang out and play with your friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>CHARACTERS</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAYAO</strong> is the best character to start with. He is by far the fastest character in the game, and in Samurai GUNN 2, that makes him one of the strongest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/4cb884d58155d9e918d0775a739084c6.poster.avif?t=1770774775\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/4cb884d58155d9e918d0775a739084c6.webm?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/4cb884d58155d9e918d0775a739084c6.mp4?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OTOMO\u00a0</strong>shoots fireballs that can trap opponents (and herself if you\u2019re not careful!). She can slash through her fire traps to gain an incredible boost of speed for a limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/224bbccbc25a6114bbed3a7ebfd89103.poster.avif?t=1770774775\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/224bbccbc25a6114bbed3a7ebfd89103.webm?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/224bbccbc25a6114bbed3a7ebfd89103.mp4?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOLEM\u00a0</strong>can create destructible stone blocks with his bullets. He can even create statues that can obstruct, frustrate, and crush opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/e898c30135b1a104ae44d2752ee04cab.poster.avif?t=1770774775\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/e898c30135b1a104ae44d2752ee04cab.webm?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/e898c30135b1a104ae44d2752ee04cab.mp4?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POPS\u00a0</strong>is slow and strong\u2013very dangerous in close quarters. He can dash-grab opponents and send them flying to their explosive deaths. He can even dash-grab their bullets and return-to-sender. His bullets explode on impact and the splash damage can kill through walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/d12fc8788b83623df1c989a772f119a8.poster.avif?t=1770774775\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/d12fc8788b83623df1c989a772f119a8.webm?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/d12fc8788b83623df1c989a772f119a8.mp4?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GHOST\u00a0</strong>has an echo float ability that makes her unpredictable in air combat. Pay close attention because her bullets are invisible, She can temporarily turn invisible as well when she dashes. Chain together successive kills to remain invisible and terrify your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/6e7c3b34b35b2084d2aa5296b0da55a6.poster.avif?t=1770774775\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/6e7c3b34b35b2084d2aa5296b0da55a6.webm?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/6e7c3b34b35b2084d2aa5296b0da55a6.mp4?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SLUG</strong> is the choice for high IQ players. So many tricks\u2013he can stick to walls and run on the ceiling. He shoots kunai instead of bullets that he (or his opponents!) can retrieve and re-fire. He can tilt the kunai in unpredictable directions. He\u2019s kind of slow, but he has a fast-fall mixup to catch opponents off-guard. Try him once you\u2019ve mastered the basics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>REGULAR UPDATES</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > See the Roadmap above for the full list of updates: completed, in progress, and planned.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1397790?t=1770774775","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/dd691733cd6c239cf4429a4cbd33dff81ef35a6f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770774775","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/9120e0bd76874630eea49712a118e6a20b35104a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770774775","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/9120e0bd76874630eea49712a118e6a20b35104a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770774775","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4375060,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Early Access Roadmap</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>//---PLAYABLE CHARACTERS---//</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Done!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Otomo |  Hayao | Slug | Pops | Ghost | Golem</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In Progress...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Helmsley</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > KD |  Isao |  Yellow Devil |  Peanut |  Mode |  Kuro |  Toshio |  Doctor |  Red |  Princess | Donk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spelunky Crew from <i>Spelunky 2</i> | Minit Gang from <i>Minit</i> | Crewmate/Imposter from <i>Among Us</i> | Ranno from <i>Rivals of Aether</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>//---MODES---//</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Done!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 and Free-for All Versus (Local)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 and Free-for-All Versus - Casual Matchmaking (Online)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 Versus - Ranked Matchmaking (Online)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic Practice Mode</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>In Progress...</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Player Onboarding</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2v2 Versus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-Specific Tutorial Modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target Practice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comic Reader</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>//---TECH---//</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Done!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a custom game engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewrite entire game in custom game engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rollback netcode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Lobbies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based Matchmaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raycast Lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck native version</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >d3d12 support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coward Punishment</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>In Progress</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash and Desync Fixes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online lobby features</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Match Spectating</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replays</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Samurai GUNN 2</i></strong> is a fighting game for people who love fast, twitchy action games.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We devoted 3 years to rebuilding Samurai GUNN 2 from scratch in our own custom engine to ensure the online matches are fast and reliable, and to make it easy for us to support for years to come. With this solid foundation in place, you can look forward to regular updates with new characters, new stages, new modes, and various other improvements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>LOCAL AND ONLINE</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against friends  on the couch, or play online in 1v1 and Free-for-All battles. Enjoy reliable rollback netcode in Ranked and Casual Matchmaking.\u00a0You can even set up a private lobby to hang out and play with your friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>CHARACTERS</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAYAO</strong> is the best character to start with. He is by far the fastest character in the game, and in Samurai GUNN 2, that makes him one of the strongest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/4cb884d58155d9e918d0775a739084c6.poster.avif?t=1770774775\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/4cb884d58155d9e918d0775a739084c6.webm?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/4cb884d58155d9e918d0775a739084c6.mp4?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OTOMO\u00a0</strong>shoots fireballs that can trap opponents (and herself if you\u2019re not careful!). She can slash through her fire traps to gain an incredible boost of speed for a limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/224bbccbc25a6114bbed3a7ebfd89103.poster.avif?t=1770774775\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/224bbccbc25a6114bbed3a7ebfd89103.webm?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/224bbccbc25a6114bbed3a7ebfd89103.mp4?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOLEM\u00a0</strong>can create destructible stone blocks with his bullets. He can even create statues that can obstruct, frustrate, and crush opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/e898c30135b1a104ae44d2752ee04cab.poster.avif?t=1770774775\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/e898c30135b1a104ae44d2752ee04cab.webm?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/e898c30135b1a104ae44d2752ee04cab.mp4?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POPS\u00a0</strong>is slow and strong\u2013very dangerous in close quarters. He can dash-grab opponents and send them flying to their explosive deaths. He can even dash-grab their bullets and return-to-sender. His bullets explode on impact and the splash damage can kill through walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/d12fc8788b83623df1c989a772f119a8.poster.avif?t=1770774775\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/d12fc8788b83623df1c989a772f119a8.webm?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/d12fc8788b83623df1c989a772f119a8.mp4?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GHOST\u00a0</strong>has an echo float ability that makes her unpredictable in air combat. Pay close attention because her bullets are invisible, She can temporarily turn invisible as well when she dashes. Chain together successive kills to remain invisible and terrify your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/6e7c3b34b35b2084d2aa5296b0da55a6.poster.avif?t=1770774775\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/6e7c3b34b35b2084d2aa5296b0da55a6.webm?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/6e7c3b34b35b2084d2aa5296b0da55a6.mp4?t=1770774775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SLUG</strong> is the choice for high IQ player